shim and MokManager, signed for Secure Boot (Microsoft UEFI CA, and Canonical),
for /usr/local/lib/ollie/secureboot. Unchanged copies from Ubuntu 24.04's
package shim-signed 1.58+15.8-0ubuntu1 (amd64):

  shimx64.efi  = /usr/lib/shim/shimx64.efi.dualsigned
                 sha256 3ed8aa3591f793de2e0886d077aae950810843caac5eaf96e1436a439bf5e150
  mmx64.efi    = /usr/lib/shim/mmx64.efi
                 sha256 d2fa8e52fddc99dad94a0009fee23cb2478c28373b777d50b2f784eb4e96f88e

shim 15.8 is new enough for Microsoft's revocations (SBAT shim,4). It starts
grubx64.efi next to it: Ollie OS's systemd-boot, signed with the Ollie OS key.

